This module has no dependencies outside the Go standard library and the
go-fast modules. It does contain tables generated from data published by
others. The tables are in internal/charset (files ending in _gen.go) and
are made by internal/charset/gen/gen.go, which names the sources. The
notices those sources ask to be kept follow.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Adobe Glyph List and ITC Zapf Dingbats glyph list

Source: glyphlist.txt and zapfdingbats.txt,
https://github.com/adobe-type-tools/agl-aglfn
Used for: internal/charset/glyphlist_gen.go (glyph names and the
characters they stand for).

