3. Encoding tables from Mozilla pdf.js

Source: src/core/encodings.js of pdf.js,
https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js, commit 74b5f3ee.
Used for: internal/charset/encodings_gen.go (which glyph each code of
StandardEncoding, WinAnsiEncoding, MacRomanEncoding and
MacExpertEncoding has, as the PDF specification lists them in its
Annex D).

